Every once in awhile there's a complaint about your pet not moving out
of the way on demand. What would be the reaction to an option "movepet"
that, when set, causes you to swap positions with your pet instead of
stopping you from moving (as "safepet" does now)? This would only happen
if you weren't stuck, somehow, to your present spot (the pet's status
isn't relevant, i don't think). This has other possibilities as well,
for example: ##@de## ... there's your pet fighting that eye and you'd
rather have it that you were doing the fighting. To prevent accidental
swapping, the option "safepet", when set in conjunction with "movepet"
would have you confirm swaps.

